                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Complete- </run>
                  <run>
All data available(trade+ post-2020 deforestation)
</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Defor. not published-</run>
                  <run>
trade reported, deforestation not published
</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>No EUDR-</run>
                  <run>
 trade and deforestation reported, but no post -2020 clearing measures
</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Not published-</run>
                  <run>&#10;no trade data released yet&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Volume only-</run>
                  <run>
 trade reported, no deforestation data exist.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
