          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6750' id='38' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='92250'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>2020 is our baseline year, before the EUDR cut-off, so it shows as complete. From 2021 we need post-2020 data, and that’s where most commodities fall short.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>Importers of 77% of EU volume can’t yet prove “deforestation-free” from public data. They will need their own plot-level traceability.</run>
